# Keep the logs and the extracted curve; leave the weights out of git.
#
# A run writes one checkpoint per save-interval learn cycles, each holding
# model.safetensors plus an optimizer state - a few megabytes apiece, tens of
# megabytes across three seeds, and none of it is what a reader of this
# experiment needs. The curve itself is extracted to summary.tsv.
results/*/
!results/*.log
